</head>
<body>

<div class="header">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Amazon Bestselling Books: Price vs. User Rating Trend Analysis</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">A decade of bestseller data (2009–2019) — examining the relationship between book pricing and customer satisfaction across Fiction and Non-Fiction genres.</div>
    <div class="meta">Data Source: Amazon Top 50 Bestsellers (2009–2019) &bull; {total} records &bull; {unique_books} unique titles &bull; Report generated April 2026</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container">

<!-- KPI Strip -->
<div class="kpi-strip">
  <div class="kpi-card">
    <div class="kpi-value">{avg_rating:.2f}</div>
    <div class="kpi-label">Avg User Rating</div>
  </div>
  <div class="kpi-card">
